    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Pagos Fiable is a payment gateway that allows you to receive card payments from your WordPress and WooCommerce online store.<br />\nThe integration is simple and optimized to provide security, speed, and reliability during the purchase process.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Full integration with WooCommerce</li>\n<li>Secure payment processing</li>\n<li>Automatic transaction validation</li>\n<li>Clear and easy-to-use interface</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin ZIP file.</li>\n<li>Upload the plugin to your WordPress site from &#8220;Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload Plugin.&#8221;</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from the administration panel.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>WooCommerce &gt; Settings &gt; Payments</strong> and enable <strong>Pagos Fiable</strong>.</li>\n<li>Configure your API credentials from the WooCommerce panel.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"do%20i%20need%20a%20pagos%20fiable%20account%3F\">\nDo I need a Pagos Fiable account?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You must register an account to obtain your API credentials.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20woocommerce%3F\">\nDoes it work with WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. This plugin requires WooCommerce to be installed and active.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20do%20i%20get%20my%20api%20keys%3F\">\nWhere do I get my API keys?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>From your user panel on <a href=\"https://vip.pagosfiable.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pagos Fiable</a>.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial version of the Pagos Fiable plugin.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Secure payment gateway integrated with WooCommerce. Allows processing payments through the Pagos Fiable service.",
    "description": "<p>Pagos Fiable is a payment gateway that allows you to receive card payments from your WordPress and WooCommerce online store.<br />\nThe integration is simple and optimized to provide security, speed, and reliability during the purchase process.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Full integration with WooCommerce</li>\n<li>Secure payment processing</li>\n<li>Automatic transaction validation</li>\n<li>Clear and easy-to-use interface</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later.</p>\n",
